{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17745","headline":"酬崔驸马惠笺百张兼贻四韵 · 杨巨源","name":"酬崔驸马惠笺百张兼贻四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百张云样乱花开，七字文头艳锦回。\n浮碧空从天上得，殷红应自日边来。\n捧持价重凌云叶，封裹香深笑海苔。\n满箧清光应照眼，欲题凡韵辄裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}